  (text "USB-C power control is connected: detected current modes, protected logic and actuator rails, input telemetry,\nheartbeat interlock, six gated button inputs, rail discharge and transient/regen clamps.\nOPEN: firmware USB-state budgets and suspend/resume; bench electrical/thermal/fault validation; PCB layout.\nOPEN: PAW3950/optics, IMU, MA735/DRV8316 wheel, RGB and final GPIO/resource allocation."
    (at 20 220 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.25 1.25))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "326f7c0d-a7a5-59c3-9eba-3ad84bff635f"))
